{"type":"heading","level":1,"text":"JOHNNY CROW'S GARDEN."}
{"type":"stanza","text":"Johnny Crow\nWould dig and sow"}
{"type":"stanza","text":"Till he made a little Garden."}
{"type":"stanza","text":"And the Lion"}
{"type":"stanza","text":"Had a green and yellow Tie on"}
{"type":"stanza","text":"In Johnny Crow's Garden."}
{"type":"stanza","text":"And the Rat\nWore a Feather in his Hat"}
{"type":"stanza","text":"But the Bear\nHad nothing to wear"}
{"type":"stanza","text":"In Johnny Crow's Garden."}
{"type":"stanza","text":"So the Ape"}
{"type":"stanza","text":"Took his Measure with a Tape"}
{"type":"stanza","text":"In Johnny Crow's Garden."}
{"type":"stanza","text":"Then the Crane"}
{"type":"stanza","text":"Was caught in the Rain"}
{"type":"stanza","text":"In Johnny Crow's Garden."}
{"type":"stanza","text":"And the Beaver"}
{"type":"stanza","text":"Was afraid he had a Fever"}
{"type":"stanza","text":"But the Goat"}
{"type":"stanza","text":"Said:"}
{"type":"stanza","text":"\"It's nothing but his Throat!\""}
{"type":"stanza","text":"In Johnny Crow's Garden."}
{"type":"stanza","text":"And the Pig\nDanced a Jig"}
{"type":"stanza","text":"In Johnny Crow's Garden."}
{"type":"stanza","text":"Then the Stork\nGave a Philosophic Talk"}
{"type":"stanza","text":"Till the Hippopotami\nSaid: \"Ask no further 'What am I?'\""}
{"type":"stanza","text":"While the Elephant\nSaid something quite irrelevant"}
{"type":"stanza","text":"In Johnny Crow's Garden."}
{"type":"stanza","text":"And the Goose--\nWell,"}
{"type":"stanza","text":"the Goose was a Goose"}
{"type":"stanza","text":"In Johnny Crow's Garden."}
{"type":"stanza","text":"And the Mouse"}
{"type":"stanza","text":"Built himself a little House"}
{"type":"stanza","text":"Where the Cat"}
{"type":"stanza","text":"Sat down beside the Mat"}
{"type":"stanza","text":"In Johnny Crow's Garden."}
{"type":"stanza","text":"And the Whale"}
{"type":"stanza","text":"Told a very long Tale"}
{"type":"stanza","text":"In Johnny Crow's Garden."}
{"type":"stanza","text":"And the Owl\nWas a funny old Fowl"}
{"type":"stanza","text":"And the Fox"}
{"type":"stanza","text":"Put them all in the Stocks"}
{"type":"stanza","text":"In Johnny Crow's Garden."}
{"type":"stanza","text":"But Johnny Crow\nHe let them go"}
{"type":"stanza","text":"And they all sat down\nto their dinner in a row"}
{"type":"stanza","text":"In Johnny Crow's Garden."}
{"type":"stanza","text":"\"GOOD-BYE!\""}
